# A live 23ai Free reply that ends the session (#2657): ORA-00603 "ORACLE server
# session terminated by irrecoverable error", then ORA-03113 twice. It answers
# a DDL whose implicit commit hit DBMS_TG_DBG's post-commit failpoint, on a
# service with COMMIT_OUTCOME on. Captured through a relay with seerdb.
